@startuml
actor "Administrateur" as A
participant "Interface Admin" as UI
participant "Application Flask" as APP
database "SQLite" as DB

== Suspension manuelle ==
A -> UI : Suspendre un usager
UI -> APP : POST /users/{id}/suspend (reason)
APP -> DB : Charger utilisateur role='user'

alt Compte introuvable
  APP --> UI : Erreur (usager introuvable)
else Compte valide
  APP -> DB : UPDATE users SET
  APP -> DB : is_suspended=1, suspension_origin='manual',
  APP -> DB : suspension_reason, suspension_date=date('now')
  APP --> UI : Usager suspendu
end

== Levee de suspension ==
A -> UI : Lever une suspension
UI -> APP : POST /users/{id}/unsuspend
APP -> DB : UPDATE users SET is_suspended=0,
suspension_reason=NULL, suspension_origin=NULL, suspension_date=NULL
APP --> UI : Suspension levee

== Synchronisation automatique ==
UI -> APP : Acces ecran protege (/admin, /users, /loans, /me...)
APP -> DB : sync_user_suspensions()
APP -> DB : Chercher emprunts en retard
note right
Condition retard:
return_date IS NULL
AND due_date < date('now')
end note
APP -> DB : Suspendre auto les usagers en retard
APP -> DB : Lever auto-suspension si plus aucun retard
@enduml
